  - master's thesis
abstract: >-
  Workshop and open educational resource, with a browser route and a
  command-line route for each exercise, for the University of
  Bern master's course "[PROJM] Github as a project management tool" (KSL
  526141, HS2026). Learners plan, conduct, document, and responsibly share a
  fictional master's thesis with one GitHub repository and one GitHub Project,
  using synthetic periodical metadata.
